  "worked_solution": "Recall that the equation of a parabolic cylinder whose axis is the $z$-axis is given by\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}=4py.\n$$\n\nThus, a parabolic cylinder whose axis is the $x$**-axis** is given by\n\n$$\n{z}^{2}=4py.\n$$\n\nTherefore, our equation is a parabolic cylinder whose axis is the $x$-axis and $p=-3.$",
